      "clang": "Derive independently from the frozen clang-lane-1 command record for the obligation's TU and its verified input closure; replace only the executable and verified source/output roots with Clang-19 and private raw-closure roots, then retain the frozen preprocessing projection plus -E -P.",
      "crossFamilyArgvReuse": "PROHIBITED",
      "acceptedCandidate": "The exact candidate closure must preprocess with return code zero and no timeout under both independently derived family projections."
